?dpl=dpl_5f9VeiTVP7x6mdFwA7RiwDk4eBKm"/></li><li class="flex h-5 shrink-0 items-center"><img alt="Y Combinator logo" loading="eager" width="99" height="20" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="h-5 w-auto object-contain" style="color:transparent" src="/rebrand/customers/ycombinator.svg?dpl=dpl_5f9VeiTVP7x6mdFwA7RiwDk4eBKm"/></li><li class="flex h-5 shrink-0 items-center"><a aria-label="Rye customer story" class="flex h-5 items-center transition-opacity hover:opacity-70" href="/customers/rye"><img alt="Rye logo" loading="eager" width="55" height="20" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="h-5 w-auto object-contain" style="color:transparent" src="/rebrand/customers/rye.svg?dpl=dpl_5f9VeiTVP7x6mdFwA7RiwDk4eBKm"/></a></li><li class="flex h-5 shrink-0 items-center"><img alt="Emergent logo" loading="eager" width="93" height="20" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="h-5 w-auto object-contain" style="color:transparent" src="/rebrand/customers/emergent.svg?dpl=dpl_5f9VeiTVP7x6mdFwA7RiwDk4eBKm"/></li></ul></div></div></div></section></div><section id="" class="relative w-full flex flex-col items-center justify-center overflow-x-clip bg-beige text-charcoal py-8 sm:py-12 lg:py-24" data-theme="light"><div class="w-full overflow-x-auto overscroll-x-none scrollbar-hide cursor-grab"><div class="flex gap-8 min-w-max items-start px-8 lg:px-16"><div class="shrink-0"><button class="group flex flex-col gap-6 w-[260px] sm:w-[300px] md:w-[360px] lg:w-[416px] shrink-0 text-left cursor-pointer"><div class="aspect-[4/3] bg-kernel-green relative overflow-hidden w-full"><div class="absolute inset-4 md:inset-5 lg:inset-7"><img alt="browser session with a cdp websocket url, headful mode, and stealth enabled" draggable="false" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-contain pointer-events-none" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" src="/rebrand/product/product_image_browser.svg?dpl=dpl_5f9VeiTVP7x6mdFwA7RiwDk4eBKm"/></div></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-4"><span class="text-label-02">sandboxed chromium</span><span class="text-body-02 md:text-body-01 lg:text-heading-06 group-hover:underline">we spin up cloud browsers in &lt;30ms for agents to act on websites</span></div></button></div><div class="shrink-0"><button class="group flex flex-col gap-6 w-[260px] sm:w-[300px] md:w-[360px] lg:w-[416px] shrink-0 text-left cursor-pointer"><div class="aspect-square bg-beige border-[0.5px] border-charcoal relative overflow-hidden w-full"><div class="absolute inset-4 md:inset-5 lg:inset-7"><img alt="kernel bot clearing a captcha grid" draggable="false" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-contain pointer-events-none" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" src="/rebrand/product/product_image_captcha.svg?dpl=dpl_5f9VeiTVP7x6mdFwA7RiwDk4eBKm"/></div></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-4"><span class="text-label-02">stealth</span><span class="text-body-02 md:text-body-01 lg:text-heading-06 group-hover:underline">we solve captchas and manage proxies to help you see fewer of them</span></div></button></div><div class="shrink-0"><button class="group flex flex-col gap-6 w-[260px] sm:w-[300px] md:w-[360px] lg:w-[416px] shrink-0 text-left cursor-pointer"><div class="aspect-[4/3] bg-beige-muted relative overflow-hidden w-full"><div class="absolute inset-4 md:inset-5 lg:inset-7"><img alt="active browser profile signed in to google and youtube" draggable="false" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-contain pointer-events-none" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" src="/rebrand/product/product_image_profiles.svg?dpl=dpl_5f9VeiTVP7x6mdFwA7RiwDk4eBKm"/></div></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-4"><span class="text-label-02">managed auth</span><span class="text-body-02 md:text-body-01 lg:text-heading-06 group-hover:underline">we automagically handle auth for your agents so you don’t have to</span></div></button></div><div class="shrink-0"><button class="group flex flex-col gap-6 w-[260px] sm:w-[300px] md:w-[360px] lg:w-[416px] shrink-0 text-left cursor-pointer"><div class="aspect-[3/2] bg-beige border-[0.5px] border-charcoal relative overflow-hidden w-full"><div class="absolute inset-4 md:inset-5 lg:inset-7"><img alt="checkout form filled from an authorized vault" draggable="false" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-contain pointer-events-none" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" src="/rebrand/product/product_image_payments.svg?dpl=dpl_5f9VeiTVP7x6mdFwA7RiwDk4eBKm"/></div></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-4"><span class="text-label-02">agentic payments</span><span class="text-body-02 md:text-body-01 lg:text-heading-06 group-hover:underline">your agent can check out with wallet integrations, like Link by Stripe</span></div></button></div><div class="shrink-0"><button class="group flex flex-col gap-6 w-[260px] sm:w-[300px] md:w-[360px] lg:w-[416px] shrink-0 text-left cursor-pointer"><div class="aspect-[4/3] bg-kernel-green relative overflow-hidden w-full"><div class="absolute inset-4 md:inset-5 lg:inset-7"><img alt="frame rate graph holding 60 fps" draggable="false" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-contain pointer-events-none" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" src="/rebrand/product/product_image_gpu-acceleration.svg?dpl=dpl_5f9VeiTVP7x6mdFwA7RiwDk4eBKm"/></div></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-4"><span class="text-label-02">gpu acceleration</span><span class="text-body-02 md:text-body-01 lg:text-heading-06 group-hover:underline">your agent can use memory-intensive and canvas-based websites</span></div></button></div><div class="shrink-0"><button class="group flex flex-col gap-6 w-[260px] sm:w-[300px] md:w-[360px] lg:w-[416px] shrink-0 text-left cursor-pointer"><div class="aspect-square bg-beige border-[0.5px] border-charcoal relative overflow-hidden w-full"><div class="absolute inset-4 md:inset-5 lg:inset-7"><img alt="deployed app notification" draggable="false" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-contain pointer-events-none" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" src="/rebrand/product/product_image_app-platform.svg?dpl=dpl_5f9VeiTVP7x6mdFwA7RiwDk4eBKm"/></div></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-4"><span class="text-label-02">browser telemetry</span><span class="text-body-02 md:text-body-01 lg:text-heading-06 group-hover:underline">your agent can use our btel api to autonomously debug errors</span></div></button></div><div class="shrink-0"><button class="group flex flex-col gap-6 w-[260px] sm:w-[300px] md:w-[360px] lg:w-[416px] shrink-0 text-left cursor-pointer"><div class="aspect-[4/3] bg-beige-muted relative overflow-hidden w-full"><div class="absolute inset-4 md:inset-5 lg:inset-7"><img alt="globe with eu and apac browser regions" draggable="false" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-contain pointer-events-none" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" src="/rebrand/product/product_image_regional-browsing.svg?dpl=dpl_5f9VeiTVP7x6mdFwA7RiwDk4eBKm"/></div></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-4"><span class="text-label-02">regional browsers</span><span class="text-body-02 md:text-body-01 lg:text-heading-06 group-hover:underline">we run browsers in the nearest region to cut latency on every action</span></div></button></div><div class="shrink-0"><button class="group flex flex-col gap-6 w-[260px] sm:w-[300px] md:w-[360px] lg:w-[416px] shrink-0 text-left cursor-pointer"><div class="aspect-[3/2] bg-beige border-[0.5px] border-charcoal relative overflow-hidden w-full"><div class="absolute inset-4 md:inset-5 lg:inset-7"><img alt="session replay player in a browser window" draggable="false" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-contain pointer-events-none" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" src="/rebrand/product/product_image_video-replay.svg?dpl=dpl_5f9VeiTVP7x6mdFwA7RiwDk4eBKm"/></div></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-4"><span class="text-label-02">o11y</span><span class="text-body-02 md:text-body-01 lg:text-heading-06 group-hover:underline">you can view sessions live and record them as mp4s for debugging</span></div></button></div></div></div></section><section id="" class="relative w-full flex flex-col items-center justify-center overflow-x-clip bg-beige text-charcoal px-8 lg:px-16 py-16 lg:py-24" data-theme="light"><div class="flex flex-col gap-4 md:flex-row md:items-baseline md:justify-between mb-8 md:mb-12 lg:mb-16 w-full"><h2 class="text-heading-05">the kernel difference</h2><div class="flex items-baseline gap-4 shrink-0"><button type="button" aria-pressed="true" class="text-label-01 lowercase cursor-pointer underline">throughput</button><button type="button" aria-pressed="false" class="text-label-01 lowercase cursor-pointer hover:underline">cold start</button></div></div><div class="w-full border-[0.5px] border-charcoal p-6 md:p-8 grid grid-cols-1 gap-8 lg:grid-cols-12"><div class="lg:col-span-4 flex flex-col justify-between gap-8"><p class="text-body-01 max-w-narrow">per-action speed inside a running session, measured by computesdk.</p><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-label-01 self-start" href="https://www.computesdk.com/benchmarks/browsers/browser-throughput/">view benchmarks</a></div><div class="lg:col-span-8 flex flex-col gap-4 md:gap-6 justify-center"><div class="relative"><div class="benchmark-bar-fill absolute inset-y-0 left-0 origin-left border-[0.5px] border-charcoal bg-transparent" style="width:56.143079315707624%"></div><div class="benchmark-bar-text relative min-w-fit flex flex-col items-start gap-1 px-4 py-4 md:flex-row md:items-center md:justify-between md:gap-4 md:px-6 md:py-8" style="width:56.143079315707624%"><span class="text-body-02 whitespace-nowrap">browser use</span><span class="text-body-02 whitespace-nowrap">3.61 actions/sec</span></div></div><div class="relative"><div class="benchmark-bar-fill absolute inset-y-0 left-0 origin-left bg-beige-muted" style="width:62.208398133748055%"></div><div class="benchmark-bar-text relative min-w-fit flex flex-col items-start gap-1 px-4 py-4 md:flex-row md:items-center md:justify-between md:gap-4 md:px-6 md:py-8" style="width:62.208398133748055%"><span class="text-body-02 whitespace-nowrap">browserbase</span><span class="text-body-02 whitespace-nowrap">4.00 actions/sec</span></div></div><div class="relative"><div class="benchmark-bar-fill absolute inset-y-0 left-0 origin-left bg-kernel-green" style="width:100%"></div><div class="benchmark-bar-text relative min-w-fit flex flex-col items-start gap-1 px-4 py-4 md:flex-row md:items-center md:justify-between md:gap-4 md:px-6 md:py-8" style="width:100%"><span class="text-body-02 whitespace-nowrap">kernel</span><span class="text-body-02 whitespace-nowrap">6.43 actions/sec</span></div></div></div></div></section><section class="w-full bg-beige text-charcoal py-8 sm:py-12 lg:py-24"><div class="flex overflow-x-auto border-t-[0.5px] border-b-[0.5px] border-grey-light-12 scrollbar-hide"><button type="button" class="grow shrink-0 basis-[192px] whitespace-nowrap border-r-[0.5px] border-grey-light-12 px-8 py-8 text-center text-body-01 text-grey-light-12 last:border-r-0 lg:px-16"><span class="underline decoration-[0.5px] underline-offset-2">qa</span></button><button type="button" class="grow shrink-0 basis-[192px] whitespace-nowrap border-r-[0.5px] border-grey-light-12 px-8 py-8 text-center text-body-01 text-grey-light-12 last:border-r-0 lg:px-16"><span class="">healthcare</span></button><button type="button" class="grow shrink-0 basis-[192px] whitespace-nowrap border-r-[0.5px] border-grey-light-12 px-8 py-8 text-center text-body-01 text-grey-light-12 last:border-r-0 lg:px-16"><span class="">e-commerce</span></button><button type="button" class="grow shrink-0 basis-[192px] whitespace-nowrap border-r-[0.5px] border-grey-light-12 px-8 py-8 text-center text-body-01 text-grey-light-12 last:border-r-0 lg:px-16"><span class="">gtm</span></button></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 border-b-[0.5px] border-grey-light-12 lg:grid-cols-2"><div class="flex aspect-[1/1] items-center justify-center bg-kernel-green p-12 md:aspect-[4/3] lg:aspect-auto lg:p-16"><img src="/rebrand/solutions/qa-bugs.svg" alt="parallel browser test run" class="w-full max-w-[350px] rounded-[4px]"/></div><div class="flex aspect-[1/1] flex-col justify-between gap-16 px-8 py-12 md:aspect-[4/3] lg:px-16 lg:py-16"><div class="flex flex-col gap-8"><p class="text-heading-05 text-grey-light-12">“<!-- -->We evaluated many options, and Kernel is the only one that could deliver the performance all of our customers&#x27; test suites required.<!-- -->”</p><p class="text-label-02 text-grey-light-12">Jinjing Liang, Co-founder &amp; CEO, Stably</p></div><a class="self-start text-label-01 text-grey-light-12 underline decoration-[0.5px] underline-offset-2" href="/solutions/qa">build <!-- -->qa<!-- --> agents</a></div></div></section><section id="" class="relative w-full flex flex-col items-center justify-center overflow-x-clip bg-beige text-charcoal px-8 lg:px-16 py-8 sm:py-12 lg:py-24 " data-theme="light"><div class="flex flex-col gap-8 md:flex-row md:items-baseline md:justify-between mb-8 md:mb-12 lg:mb-16 w-full"><h2 class="text-heading-05">loved by 11,000+ teams building agents</h2><a class="text-label-01 shrink-0" href="/customers">view all</a></div><div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row w-full"><div class="flex-1 border-[0.5px] border-charcoal overflow-hidden"><div class="md:hidden p-6 flex flex-col gap-6"><div class="w-full flex items-cent