 gap-8 p-8 aspect-[3/2]"><div class="flex items-center justify-center border-[0.5px] border-charcoal p-8 order-1"><img alt="effective" loading="lazy" width="160" height="40" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="h-8 w-auto" style="color:transparent" src="/rebrand/customers/effective.svg?dpl=dpl_5f9VeiTVP7x6mdFwA7RiwDk4eBKm"/></div><div class="flex flex-col justify-between order-2"><div class="flex flex-col gap-8"><h3 class="text-heading-06"><span class="inline-block w-[7px] h-[7px] rounded-full bg-kernel-green align-middle mr-2"></span>effective</h3><p class="text-body-01">runs 10mm+ insurance regulatory filings &amp; 24/7 workloads on kernel</p></div><a class="text-label-01 self-start" href="/customers/effective">read story</a></div></div></div></div></section><section id="" class="relative w-full flex flex-col items-center justify-center overflow-x-clip bg-beige text-charcoal px-8 lg:px-16 py-16 lg:py-24" data-theme="light"><div class="w-full"><h2 class="text-heading-05 mb-8 md:mb-12 lg:mb-16">friends of kernel</h2></div><div class="w-full grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-8 items-start"><a class="group flex flex-col gap-6 no-hover-underline" href="/blog/claude-managed-agents"><div class="w-full flex items-center justify-center border-[0.5px] border-charcoal aspect-[3/2]"><img alt="anthropic" loading="lazy" width="70" height="32" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="h-8 w-auto" style="color:transparent" src="/rebrand/assets/icon-anthropic-light.svg?dpl=dpl_5f9VeiTVP7x6mdFwA7RiwDk4eBKm"/></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-3"><span class="text-label-02">anthropic</span><h3 class="text-heading-06 group-hover:underline">how we partnered with anthropic on claude managed agents</h3></div></a><a class="group flex flex-col gap-6 no-hover-underline" href="/blog/stripe-projects"><div class="w-full flex items-center justify-center border-[0.5px] border-charcoal aspect-square"><img alt="stripe" loading="lazy" width="70" height="32" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="h-8 w-auto" style="color:transparent" src="/rebrand/assets/icon-stripe-light.svg?dpl=dpl_5f9VeiTVP7x6mdFwA7RiwDk4eBKm"/></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-3"><span class="text-label-02">stripe</span><h3 class="text-heading-06 group-hover:underline">how we partnered with stripe on stripe projects</h3></div></a><a class="group flex flex-col gap-6 no-hover-underline" href="/docs/integrations/1password"><div class="w-full flex items-center justify-center border-[0.5px] border-charcoal aspect-[3/2]"><img alt="1password" loading="lazy" width="70" height="32" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="h-8 w-auto" style="color:transparent" src="/rebrand/assets/icon-1password-light.svg?dpl=dpl_5f9VeiTVP7x6mdFwA7RiwDk4eBKm"/></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-3"><span class="text-label-02">1password</span><h3 class="text-heading-06 group-hover:underline">how we partnered with 1password to rethink auth for agents</h3></div></a><a class="group flex flex-col gap-6 no-hover-underline" href="/blog/webbotauth"><div class="w-full flex items-center justify-center border-[0.5px] border-charcoal aspect-[4/3]"><img alt="vercel" loading="lazy" width="70" height="32" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="h-8 w-auto" style="color:transparent" src="/rebrand/assets/icon-vercel-light.svg?dpl=dpl_5f9VeiTVP7x6mdFwA7RiwDk4eBKm"/></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-3"><span class="text-label-02">vercel</span><h3 class="text-heading-06 group-hover:underline">how we partnered with vercel to support web bot auth</h3></div></a></div></section><section id="" class="relative w-full flex flex-col items-center justify-center overflow-x-clip bg-beige text-charcoal px-8 py-16 lg:px-16 lg:py-24" data-theme="light"><div class="grid w-full grid-cols-1 gap-8 lg:grid-cols-12"><div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-8 lg:col-span-8 lg:col-start-3"><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="49" height="96" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="h-24 w-auto" style="color:transparent" src="/rebrand/cta/hypeman.svg?dpl=dpl_5f9VeiTVP7x6mdFwA7RiwDk4eBKm"/><div class="flex w-full flex-col items-center gap-8"><h2 class="text-heading-04 text-center text-grey-light-12 md:text-heading-03 lg:text-heading-02">give your agent the internet</h2><div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-4"><div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-2"><a class="inline-flex items-center justify-center font-normal leading-brand tracking-normal transition-all duration-200 cursor-pointer whitespace-nowrap disabled:opacity-50 disabled:cursor-not-allowed bg-charcoal text-beige! hover:underline rounded-lg px-8 py-4 text-lg  h-14 gap-4 rounded-none bg-grey-light-12! text-label-01! lowercase" href="/prompt.md" aria-label="copy prompt"><span class="flex items-center gap-1"><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="16" height="16" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="size-4" style="color:transparent" src="/rebrand/cta/claude.svg?dpl=dpl_5f9VeiTVP7x6mdFwA7RiwDk4eBKm"/><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="16" height="16" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="size-4" style="color:transparent" src="/rebrand/cta/openai.svg?dpl=dpl_5f9VeiTVP7x6mdFwA7RiwDk4eBKm"/></span><span class="grid text-center"><span aria-hidden="false" class="col-start-1 row-start-1 visible">copy prompt</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="col-start-1 row-start-1 invisible">copied!</span></span><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="size-6" style="color:transparent" src="/rebrand/cta/copy.svg?dpl=dpl_5f9VeiTVP7x6mdFwA7RiwDk4eBKm"/></a><span class="sr-only" aria-live="polite"></span></div><a class="text-label-01" href="/docs/cookbooks">see cookbooks</a></div></div></div></div></section><noscript><section id="" class="relative w-full flex flex-col items-center justify-center overflow-x-clip bg-beige text-charcoal px-8 lg:px-16 py-8 sm:py-12 lg:py-24 " data-theme="light"><div class="
        w-full mx-auto px-8 lg:px-16
        max-w-[752px]
        
      "><div class="flex flex-col gap-6"><h2 class="text-heading-05 text-grey-light-12">use KERNEL without javascript</h2><p class="text-body-expanded-01 text-grey-light-12">KERNEL gives web agents isolated cloud browsers for work that requires a real website rather than a purpose-built api. create a headless or headful chromium session, connect through cdp or webdriver bidi, execute playwright code in the browser vm, or use computer controls for screenshot-driven agents. profiles preserve browser state between sessions. managed auth keeps user-approved login state available without putting passwords or mfa codes in the agent conversation.</p><p class="text-body-expanded-01 text-grey-light-12">start with the openapi specification for direct http integration, the hosted mcp server for compatible tool-calling agents, or the official cli for terminal workflows. the typescript, python, and go sdks expose the same public api with typed request and response models. live view, replays, logs, and telemetry show what happened during a run. browser pools keep configured browsers ready for repeated, latency-sensitive workloads, while on-demand sessions fit occasional and bursty work.</p><p class="text-body-expanded-01 text-grey-light-12">authenticate api requests with a KERNEL api key and delete each browser session when the task is complete. agents should read the documentation index before choosing an endpoint, use the published schemas instead of guessing parameters, and preserve the returned error code when asking a human for help.</p><ul class="flex flex-col gap-3 text-body-01"><li><a href="/docs">documentation</a></li><li><a href="/llms.txt">agent index</a></li><li><a href="/openapi.json">openapi specification</a></li><li><a href="/auth.md">authentication instructions</a></li></ul></div></div></section></noscript></main><footer id="footer" class="relative w-full flex flex-col items-start justify-center max-w-screen overflow-hidden text-charcoal" style="background-color:#