pi. create a headless or headful chromium session, connect through cdp or webdriver bidi, execute playwright code in the browser vm, or use computer controls for screenshot-driven agents. profiles preserve browser state between sessions. managed auth keeps user-approved login state available without putting passwords or mfa codes in the agent conversation.\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-body-expanded-01 text-grey-light-12\",\"children\":\"start with the openapi specification for direct http integration, the hosted mcp server for compatible tool-calling agents, or the official cli for terminal workflows. the typescript, python, and go sdks expose the same public api with typed request and response models. live view, replays, logs, and telemetry show what happened during a run. browser pools keep configured browsers ready for repeated, latency-sensitive workloads, while on-demand sessions fit occasional and bursty work.\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-body-expanded-01 text-grey-light-12\",\"children\":\"authenticate api requests with a KERNEL api key and delete each browser session when the task is complete. agents should read the documentation index before choosing an endpoint, use the published schemas instead of guessing parameters, and preserve the returned error code when asking a human for help.\"}],[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"className\":\"flex flex-col gap-3 text-body-01\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L31\",null,{\"href\":\"/docs\",\"ref\":\"$undefined\",\"children\":\"documentation\"}]}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L31\",null,{\"href\":\"/llms.txt\",\"ref\":\"$undefined\",\"children\":\"agent index\"}]}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L31\",null,{\"href\":\"/openapi.json\",\"ref\":\"$undefined\",\"children\":\"openapi specification\"}]}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L31\",null,{\"href\":\"/auth.md\",\"ref\":\"$undefined\",\"children\":\"authentication instructions\"}]}]]}]